  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2e9cc6deb084a9cb190c2866b091a4fcda816f07_0.webp\" alt=\"­\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/48a1954f14e2e1d4816014bddff2f6e705d10158.png\" alt=\"­\"></p>\n<p><strong>Dynamic light</strong> 是一個資料包／模組，加入了社群強烈要求的功能：動態光源。</p>\n<p>部分生物在 <strong>著火</strong> 時，或手中 <strong>持有 light_source</strong> 時，會發出光芒。</p>\n<p>Dynamic light 的主要亮點在於提升遊戲的沉浸感。趕快來玩吧！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;YouTube 影片&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>官方網站</h1>\n<p>如果您有任何問題、需要協助，或只是想分享您的想法與回饋，歡迎隨時與我們聯繫。我們隨時準備為您提供幫助，也非常期待聽到您的聲音——無論您是尋求解答、建議，或只是想告訴我們目前的進度如何。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiessee.altervista.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1145865/description_2c46616a-8a70-4d88-b744-b5ca8c6e9ce0.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>其他連結</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fit.fiverr.com%252fdiesse2007\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1939f49bcb6e53e1f7c526c007eeb1be4a69aeb2.png\" alt=\"­\">‎</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fdskianto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/169f5456fb11650701a2af7890b911e62386388e_0.webp\" alt=\"­\">‎</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwanmine.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c38479243db42f491e3674a0ccda6de2c934b7f.png\" alt=\"­\">‎</a></p>",
